  {
   "id": "header-group:announcement-bar/announcement-bar-0/text",
   "resource_type": "section_group",
   "file_or_handle": "sections/header-group.json",
   "key_path": "sections.announcement-bar.blocks.announcement-bar-0.settings.text",
   "en": "FREE SHIPPING & 60-DAY GUARANTEE FOR MEMBERS · BELGIAN-MADE · EST. 2017",
   "en_sha1": "b4f5fb0b87d8d23a5dab8de173c2d065f017ef83",
   "fr": "LIVRAISON OFFERTE & SATISFAIT OU REMBOURSÉ 60 JOURS POUR LES MEMBRES · FABRIQUÉ EN BELGIQUE · DEPUIS 2017",
   "status": "translated",
   "flags": [],
   "notes": "claim C103 confirmed by Victor 21 Oct ('EST. 2017 is bevestigd', CLAIMS-REVIEW.md), so no pending-claim-review; EN is Victor's short line of 21 Oct; 'SATISFAIT OU REMBOURSÉ 60 JOURS' kept for '60-DAY GUARANTEE' as elsewhere in FR, because a bare 'garantie' reads as the legal warranty; 'EST.' as 'DEPUIS'; 'membres' as elsewhere in FR",
   "source_status": "corrected"
  },
  {
   "id": "header-group:header/cta_text",
   "resource_type": "section_group",
   "file_or_handle": "sections/header-group.json",
   "key_path": "sections.header.settings.cta_text",
   "en": "BEGIN NOW",
   "en_sha1": "3af682098c74f0572917a3032d55af4fd973a8de",
   "fr": "COMMENCER",
   "status": "translated",
   "flags": [],
   "notes": "Header CTA; 'NOW' dropped to fit ('COMMENCER', 9 chars vs EN 9).",
   "source_status": "approved"
  },
  {
   "id": "footer-group:footer/slogan",
   "resource_type": "section_group",
   "file_or_handle": "sections/footer-group.json",
   "key_path": "sections.footer.settings.slogan",
   "en": "Your mouth has a rhythm[[br]]Now your oral care too",
   "en_sha1": "2d16442b381544eaac8df6e3b9e0f89522c1f3d8",
   "fr": "Votre bouche a son rythme[[br]]Désormais, vos soins aussi",
   "status": "translated",
   "flags": [],
   "notes": "Victor 23 Oct: follows the EN slogan of 22 Oct ('Your mouth has a rhythm Now your oral care too'); FR as the approved FR homepage hero ('Votre bouche a son rythme / Désormais, vos soins aussi'); [[br]] marks the line break, as in the EN and NL.",
   "source_status": "corrected"
  },
  {
   "id": "footer-group:footer/copyright_text",
   "resource_type": "section_group",
   "file_or_handle": "sections/footer-group.json",
   "key_path": "sections.footer.settings.copyright_text",
   "en": "<p>Copyright © ∞ KARMICARE. All rights reserved. KARMICARE™ Biorhythmic Toothpaste Kit (Awake + Asleep) is a Belgian product formulated by certified chemists and manufactured under GMP. Formulations are CPNP notified and comply with the EU Cosmetic Regulation (EC) No 1223/2009. Packaging (Awake, Asleep bottle and shipping envelope) are recyclable.</p><p>KARMICARE™ is a brand of KARMICA bv. Vizierstraat 28, 8000, Belgium. Company number 0676.972.896 and VAT number BE0676.972.896 - Belfius: BE73 0689 0664 2960.</p>",
   "en_sha1": "b2d215640991f2039c2d1ca3b244c7f48b57a864",
   "fr": "<p>Copyright © ∞ KARMICARE. Tous droits réservés. Le KARMICARE™ Biorhythmic Toothpaste Kit (Awake + Asleep) est une création belge, formulée par des chimistes certifiés et fabriquée selon les BPF. Les formules sont notifiées au CPNP et conformes au règlement (CE) n° 1223/2009 relatif aux produits cosmétiques. Les emballages (flacons Awake et Asleep et enveloppe d’expédition) sont recyclables.</p><p>KARMICARE™ est une marque de KARMICA bv. Vizierstraat 28, 8000, Belgium. Numéro d’entreprise 0676.972.896 et numéro de TVA BE0676.972.896 - Belfius : BE73 0689 0664 2960.</p>",
   "status": "translated",
   "flags": [
    "pending-claim-review",
    "legal-review",
    "wording-adapted"
   ],
   "notes": "Company name, numbers, VAT, IBAN and street address kept exactly. 'a Belgian product' rendered 'une création belge' (banned word 'product'); the regulation keeps its official French title. The address has no city after 8000 in the EN either. R2 F8 (CHANGES-R2 §6): postal addresses exactly as in the EN; the official French forms (boîte 1, Bruxelles, Belgique) only if Victor decides so. Claims C99 need Clinical Research sign-off; translated faithfully, not softened.",
   "source_status": "corrected",
   "claims": [
    "C99"
   ]
  },
